TEXNIK TOPSHIRIQ (TZ)
Loyiha: XYZ — matematika onlayn ta’lim platformasi
Versiya: 2.0
Sana: 2026-07-29
Asosiy papka: /home/neo/Desktop/xyz
================================================================================


1. LOYIHA MAQSADI
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
XYZ — universitet kirish imtihoniga (asosan matematika) tayyorlanuvchi
o‘quvchilar uchun onlayn platforma.

Asosiy funksiyalar:
  • Video darslar + har dars uchun 10 savollik test
  • Freemium (bitta bepul dars + test)
  • Obuna (admin qo‘lda yoki so‘rov orqali)
  • Progress va o‘quvchi reytingi
  • O‘qituvchi reytingi (1–5 yulduz)
  • Jonli dars (WebRTC + chat)
  • O‘qituvchi va admin panellari


2. MAHSULOT QOIDALARI
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2.1. Kontent ierarxiyasi (o‘zgartirilmaydi)
     Dars (Subject — UI da «Darslar»)
       → Kurs (Course)
         → Modul (Module)
           → Mavzu (Topic)
             → Video dars (Lesson)
               → 10 ta savol (test)
               → Natija (ExamAttempt)
               → Progress

2.2. Freemium
  • Bitta barqaror bepul video: Lesson.is_free_preview = True (pin)
  • Pin bo‘lmasa — eng kichik id li faol dars
  • Bepul dars + 10 talik test obunasiz
  • Qolgan kontent — faol obuna bilan

2.3. Video → Test
  • Video kamida 70% ko‘rilishi kerak (MIN_WATCH_PERCENT_TO_COMPLETE)
  • «Tugatildi» → shu darsning testi ochiladi
  • Har video = qat’iy 10 ta faol savol
  • Har savolda ≥4 javob, 1 ta to‘g‘ri

2.4. Obuna
  • Holat: ACTIVE / EXPIRED
  • Admin: 30 / 90 / 180 kunlik obuna berish
  • Foydalanuvchi: Obuna sahifasidan tarif tanlab so‘rov yuboradi
  • Onlayn to‘lov (Payme/Click) — hozircha YO‘Q
  • Narxlar admin paneldan boshqariladi (SubscriptionPricing)

2.5. Rollar
  • STUDENT — o‘quvchi (default)
  • TEACHER — /teacher/ panel
  • ADMIN — /admin/ to‘liq boshqaruv
  • MODERATOR — rezerv


3. FOYDALANUVCHI ROLLARI VA HUQUQLAR
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3.1. Mehmon (guest)
  • Bosh sahifa, asoschi/o‘qituvchi profillari
  • Jonli dars tomoshasi (/live/)
  • Reyting — faqat TOP-3
  • Ro‘yxatdan o‘tish / kirish

3.2. O‘quvchi (login)
  • Darslar, video, test, progress kabineti
  • To‘liq reyting (/reyting/)
  • O‘qituvchilarni 1–5 yulduz baholash (dars sahifasida)
  • O‘qituvchilar reytingi (/reyting/oqituvchilar/)
  • Jonli dars chatiga yozish
  • Obuna so‘rovi

3.3. O‘qituvchi
  • /teacher/ — kontent CRUD
  • /live/host/ — jonli efir boshqaruvi + chat javoblari

3.4. Administrator
  • /admin/ — hamma modellar
  • Obuna narxlari, hero video, kontaktlar
  • Jonli efirlar, o‘qituvchi baholari


4. FUNKSIONAL TALABLAR
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

4.1. Core (bosh sahifa)
  FR-C1. Landing: brend, CTA, asoschilar, o‘qituvchilar
  FR-C2. Hero video: admin yuklash, autoplay muted loop, controls yo‘q,
         seek/pause/duration ko‘rinmaydi
  FR-C3. Asoschi / o‘qituvchi batafsil sahifalar
  FR-C4. Oy o‘quvchisi banner
  FR-C5. Reyting preview: guest 3, login 5 (bosh sahifada)
  FR-C6. Indigo / to‘q ko‘k / neon (tilla + och ko‘k) gradient dizayn

4.2. Reyting
  FR-R1. O‘quvchi reytingi /reyting/ — guest top-3, login to‘liq + «Siz»
  FR-R2. O‘qituvchi reytingi /reyting/oqituvchilar/ — faqat login
  FR-R3. O‘quvchi dars ko‘rgach o‘qituvchiga 1–5 yulduz + izoh

4.3. Jonli dars (apps.live)
  FR-L1. /live/ — hammaga ochiq (LIVE efir yoki oxirgi efir)
  FR-L2. /live/host/ — o‘qituvchi/admin efir boshlash/tugatish
  FR-L3. WebRTC: o‘qituvchi kamera → tomoshabinlar
  FR-L4. Chat: yozish login bilan; o‘qish hammaga
  FR-L5. O‘qituvchi chatda javob beradi (is_from_teacher)

4.4. Education
  FR-E1. Darslar ro‘yxati (UI: «Darslar», model: Subject)
  FR-E2. Fan → Kurs → Modul → Mavzu → Video navigatsiya
  FR-E3. Video watch progress (≥70% → complete)
  FR-E4. Qulflangan darsda obuna CTA

4.5. Exam
  FR-X1. 10 savol, vaqt limiti (ixtiyoriy), o‘tish foizi (default 70%)
  FR-X2. Natija + tushuntirishlar + tarix

4.6. Subscription
  FR-S1. Obuna holati
  FR-S2. Tarif kartochkalari (admin narxlari)
  FR-S3. So‘rov formasi (SubscriptionRequest)
  FR-S4. Kontakt kanallari

4.7. Teacher panel
  FR-T1. Fan/kurs/modul/mavzu/dars CRUD
  FR-T2. Savollar CRUD (10 ta limit)
  FR-T3. Test sozlamalari

4.8. Admin panel
  FR-AD1. O‘zbekcha UI + tezkor havolalar
  FR-AD2. Obuna narxlari CRUD
  FR-AD3. Hero video (SiteSettings)
  FR-AD4. Jonli efirlar va chat xabarlari
  FR-AD5. O‘qituvchi baholari ko‘rish/o‘chirish


5. NOFUNKSIONAL TALABLAR
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
5.1. Stack
  • Django 5.1 + Templates (DRF yo‘q)
  • channels 4.2 + daphne 4.1 (WebSocket / WebRTC signaling)
  • Bootstrap 5, custom CSS (main.css)
  • PostgreSQL (yagona baza; SQLite/MongoDB ishlatilmaydi)
  • Session authentication

5.2. Apps
  apps.core, apps.accounts, apps.education, apps.exam,
  apps.progress, apps.subscription, apps.teacher, apps.live

5.3. Dizayn
  • Ranglar: indigo (#6366f1), to‘q ko‘k (#0b1024), neon tilla (#c9a227),
    och ko‘k (#38bdf8)
  • Responsive: mobil nav, grid, jadvallar
  • Til: o‘zbek (lotin), TIME_ZONE = Asia/Tashkent

5.4. Xavfsizlik
  • SECRET_KEY .env dan
  • CSRF, login_required, can_manage_content checks
  • WebSocket: AllowedHostsOriginValidator + AuthMiddlewareStack


6. URL XARITASI
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  /                              — landing + hero video
  /reyting/                      — o‘quvchi reyting (guest 3 / login full)
  /reyting/oqituvchilar/         — o‘qituvchi reyting (login)
  /reyting/oqituvchi/<id>/baho/  — baho POST
  /asoschi/<id>/                 — asoschi profil
  /oqituvchi/<id>/               — o‘qituvchi profil
  /live/                         — jonli dars tomosha
  /live/host/                    — efir boshqaruvi
  /live/<id>/chat/               — chat POST (fallback)
  /accounts/                     — login, register, profile, password reset
  /education/subjects/           — Darslar
  /exam/                         — test start/take/submit/result/history
  /progress/dashboard/           — kabinet
  /subscription/info/            — obuna + tarif + so‘rov
  /teacher/                      — o‘qituvchi panel
  /admin/                        — boshqaruv paneli
  /ws/live/<session_id>/         — WebSocket (signaling + chat)


7. MA’LUMOTLAR MODELI
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SiteSettings (singleton)
  hero_video, hero_video_active

Founder, StudentOfTheMonth

CustomUser
  role, phone, avatar, specialty, bio, full_bio, education,
  achievements, telegram, show_on_homepage, homepage_order

TeacherRating
  student, teacher, lesson (nullable), stars (1–5), comment
  unique(student, teacher, lesson)

Subject / Course / Module / Topic / Lesson
  Lesson: video, pdf, duration, is_free_preview, created_by

Question / Answer / ExamSettings / ExamAttempt

LessonProgress / TopicProgress
  watch_percent, is_completed

Subscription / SubscriptionPricing / SubscriptionRequest / ContactChannel

LiveSession
  title, host, status (SCHEDULED/LIVE/ENDED), started_at, ended_at

LiveChatMessage
  session, user, text, is_from_teacher


8. UI/UX TALABLARI
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
8.1. Bosh sahifa hero video
  • autoplay, muted, loop, playsinline
  • controls yo‘q, seek/pause bloklangan
  • duration UI ko‘rinmaydi
  • Video yo‘q → gradient hero fallback

8.2. Reyting
  • Mehmon: 3 ta o‘quvchi + «to‘liq uchun kirish» CTA
  • Login: to‘liq ro‘yxat, «Siz» belgisi

8.3. Jonli dars
  • YouTube-style: video chapda, chat o‘ngda
  • LIVE badge, mobilda stack layout

8.4. Nomlar
  • UI da «Fanlar» → «Darslar» (platforma faqat matematika)


9. QABUL KRITERIYALARI
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
AC1. Admin narxi o‘zgarsa — Obuna sahifasida yangi narx ko‘rinadi
AC2. Admin hero video yuklasa — bosh sahifada ovozsiz aylanadi, controls yo‘q
AC3. Guest reytingda 3 ta, login da to‘liq
AC4. O‘qituvchi efir boshlasa — /live/ da ko‘rinadi, chat ishlaydi
AC5. O‘quvchi darsdan keyin o‘qituvchiga 1–5 yulduz beradi
AC6. O‘qituvchilar reytingi faqat login bilan ochiladi
AC7. Bepul dars + 10 test obunasiz ishlaydi
AC8. Obuna so‘rovi admin panelda ko‘rinadi


