12. O‘RNATISH
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  cd /home/neo/Desktop/xyz
  python3 -m venv .venv
  source .venv/bin/activate
  pip install -r requirements.txt
  cp .env.example .env
  python manage.py migrate
  python manage.py seed_demo
  python manage.py runserver 127.0.0.1:8000

  # WebSocket uchun runserver yetarli (daphne INSTALLED_APPS da)
  # Prod: daphne -b 0.0.0.0 -p 8000 config.asgi:application


13. ADMIN BO‘LIMLARI
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Sayt kontenti     — Asoschilar, Oy o‘quvchisi, Sayt sozlamalari (hero video)
  Foydalanuvchilar  — CustomUser, O‘qituvchi baholari
  Matematika dasturi — Darslar, Kurslar, Modullar, Mavzular, Video darslar
  Test tizimi       — Savollar, Test sozlamalari, Urinishlar
  Natijalar         — Dars/Mavzu progresslari
  Obuna             — Obunalar, Obuna narxlari, So‘rovlar, Kontaktlar
  Jonli dars        — Jonli efirlar, Chat xabarlari


14. CHEGARALAR
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
